'''Salazzle''' (Japanese: '''エンニュート''' ''Ennewt'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

