==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Salazzle|16}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*'''Poison Claws''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Persian|42}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
